{"sections":[{"slug":"幂零完备化","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"幂零完备化"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">幂零完备化</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“幂零完备化”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $E$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/环谱","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">环谱</span>"}},{"Plain":", $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为谱</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">取</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $E$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/Adams消解","text":"Adams <span lang=\"zh\">消解</span>"}},{"Plain":" $X_\\bullet \\to X$, <span lang=\"zh\">称其同伦极限</span> $\\lim_n X_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">关于</span> $E$ <span lang=\"zh\">的幂零完备化</span> (nilpotent completion).</p>\n"}]}}}]}